s+='''<section><h2>Claim lines for your review</h2><ul><li>About 0:20: “It\'s free.” Confirm it matches the offer the ad will send viewers to.</li><li>About 0:30: “exactly how much fat you have to lose and where you need to gain muscle.” This states exact measurement from a photo.</li><li>About 0:41 - 0:47: plan changes “in seconds,” including injury, and “updates instantly.” The source clip alone does not verify those promises.</li></ul><p>The filmed words remain intact. No new numerical claims were added to the graphics.</p></section><details><summary>Checks, limits and costs</summary><p>Passed: per-file lav selection; shared audio-chain self-test; source inventory; same-person provenance. Tentative: take selection and pause map. Invalid: the cut-audio reviewer returned a text-only answer, so no acoustic pass was recorded. Pending: finished opening, caption alignment, every full-file gate, complete watch/listen, independent audit and final delivery.</p><p>Review estimate was under $2. Actual billing and editor token totals are not exposed. No AI image or video generation was purchased. The full ad is not marked delivered.</p></details><button onclick="save()">Download decisions JSON</button><p class="muted">Selections save in this browser. Download the decisions file, or send your choices in chat.</p></main><script>
function play(p){const v=document.getElementById('player');v.src=p;v.load();v.play();document.getElementById('now').textContent=p;v.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});}
function state(){let d={job:'RA-13',round:1,decisions:{}};document.querySelectorAll('[data-id]').forEach(e=>d.decisions[e.dataset.id]={verdict:e.value,notes:document.querySelector('[data-note="'+e.dataset.id+'"]').value});return d;}
function keep(){localStorage.setItem('ra13-r1-decisions',JSON.stringify(state()));}
document.querySelectorAll('select,textarea').forEach(e=>e.addEventListener('change',keep));
try{let d=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('ra13-r1-decisions'));Object.entries(d.decisions).forEach(([k,v])=>{document.querySelector('[data-id="'+k+'"]').value=v.verdict;document.querySelector('[data-note="'+k+'"]').value=v.notes;});}catch(e){}
function save(){keep();let a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(state(),null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));a.download='RA-13-R1-decisions.json';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href);}
</script></body></html>'''
